OL,3,AMan in court charged with murder over
OL,4,AArmadale shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murdering another man who was shot
OL,8,Fdead in West Lothian.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a property on
OL,11,FHarestanes Road in Armadale at about
OL,12,F11:50 on Saturday.
OL,14,FBilly Watson, 35, was found injured and
OL,15,Fdied at the scene.
OL,17,FFrank McCarthy, 57, appeared at
OL,18,FLivingston Sheriff Court on Friday,
OL,19,Fcharged with murder and attempting to
OL,20,Fdefeat the ends of justice. He made no
OL,21,Fplea and was remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
